  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a Resilient Social Protection System in Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF&#x2019;s, UNDP&#x2019;s and WFP&#x2019;s joint action comes to put in place an agile, integrated, human-centered and shock-responsive social protection system in Armenia that builds a person&#x2019;s resilience to vulnerability, deprivation and crises across the lifecycle. This will be achieved through four interlinked components, showing a sequenced logic of interventions across policy and legal framework development, administrative data system strengthening and integration, capacity building and prototyping.</narrative>
  </description>
